---
description: Run the repository post-edit review gate after code changes.
alwaysApply: true
---

After adding, updating, or removing code, apply this review gate before the final response.

The single source of truth is `.ai/HARNESS.md` under **Post-Edit Review Gate**. Follow that
section exactly for:

- when the gate runs
- the skip allowlist
- the required review personas
- reporting rules

Use the five review personas defined there and mirrored in `.ai/extras/agents/`:

- `.ai/extras/agents/architecture-review-agent.md`
- `.ai/extras/agents/coding-best-practices-review-agent.md`
- `.ai/extras/agents/owasp-top-10-agent.md`
- `.ai/extras/agents/security-review-agent.md`
- `.ai/extras/agents/project-conventions-agent.md`

Run the gate against recently modified or newly created files only. Do not restate or weaken
the canonical rules from `.ai/HARNESS.md` here.
